# Aknowlagments

The math library is based on raylib's raymath <https://github.com/raysan5/raylib>

# Known Issues

E = Easy fix
H = Time consuming
? = Unknown cause
! = A real pickle

- Maximum 2 Drawers (E)
- Unable to delete Drawables (H)
- DrawableSetTransform has no effect (?)
- Window height randomly increases (!)
